	(text_box "U401 STM32U585ZIT6 (LQFP144, LDO version without SMPS): every pin"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(size 140 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b0aff58-7f96-583d-adfe-5688ece8580a")
	)
	(text_box "Pin numbers and names from KiCad's stock symbol STM32U585ZITx, cross-checked row by row against DS13086 Rev 10 Table 27\n(LQFP144 column, non-SMPS). Alternate-function numbers from Tables 28/29. All 114 port pins are in analog mode after reset\n(DS13086 §3.13) except the debug pins PA13 (pull-up), PA14 (pull-down), PA15 (pull-up), PB4 (pull-up) and PB3 (Table 27\nnote 5); none of those five carries a contract signal.\nPhase commands: one advanced timer, TIM1 channels 1-4 (PE9, PE11, PE13, PE14, AF1), with the sequencer fault BR_FAULT_N on\nTIM1's break input (PE15, AF1) so a sequencer fault also forces the timer outputs inactive. The bootloader's pins (marked\n\"(boot)\" in Table 27) carry no shock, consent or charger output.\nConsent clock HOLD_M_CLK (PD12) is a plain GPIO toggled by the control loop (F-1); TIM4_CH1 is on the same pin for a\none-pulse-mode variant, never a free-running timer. Issue 3: HOLD_M_CLK at 1.5 kHz +/- 10 %, always stopped low (contract\n§0). K_SUPPLY_EN (PD7, push-pull, high-Z from reset; the 100 kOhm default to GND is on 14) switches the relay-coil supply\non >= 0.2 s before RELAY_CMD. Second-sensor readbacks HOLD_RB_A2_N/HOLD_RB_B2_N on PG0/PG1 (VDD domain, not VDDIO2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(size 140 25.749)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74b51d5e-5ade-52ba-945b-98e0c04e7483")
	)
	(text_box "U401 supply decoupling (DS13086 Figure 24) and VDDA filter"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.72 25.4 0)
		(size 261.635 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "912a4487-658a-58a9-86e6-871bd85a13d3")
	)
	(text_box "VDD: 9 pins, 100 nF each + 10 uF. VDDIO2 (port G is used, so it is tied to 3V3_MAIN): 2 x 100 nF + 4.7 uF. VDDA and VREF+ (tied together; the ADC reference is the analog supply, needed because I_SHOCK spans 0-3.2 V): 100 nF + 1 uF\neach, fed from 3V3_MAIN through a ferrite bead (VDDA_M). VDDUSB (USB not used): to VDD as the datasheet prefers, 100 nF. VBAT: no backup cell (the RV-3028 on 03 keeps time), tied to VDD with 100 nF. VCAP (LDO output): 4.7 uF, ESR <\n20 mOhm at 3 MHz, >= 10 V (DS13086 §5.1.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.72 31.75 0)
		(size 261.635 8.477)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "64e772e4-ed36-5641-b260-bddfc1d8fc80")
	)
	(text_box "Clocks: 16 MHz HSE crystal (core, bridge timer) and 32.768 kHz LSE crystal"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 467.675 25.4 0)
		(size 181.06 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6a93dca6-0d39-5151-b93b-f3436c7323fb")
	)
	(text_box "HSE: ABM8 16 MHz, CL 10 pF, ESR <= 70 Ohm, C0 <= 3 pF. Load caps 10 pF C0G each: CL = 10*10/(10+10) + Cstray (~4.5 pF est.) = 9.5 pF. Crystal gm_crit =\n4*ESR*(2*pi*f)^2*(C0+CL)^2 = 0.48 mA/V < Gmcritmax 1.5 mA/V (Table 80).\nLSE: ABS07 32.768 kHz, CL 7 pF, ESR <= 70 kOhm. Load caps 4.7 pF C0G each: CL = 2.35 pF + Cstray (CS_PARA 3-5 pF + ~1 pF board) = 6.4-8.4 pF. gm_crit = 0.96\nuA/V: needs LSEDRV = medium-high (1.7 uA/V max, Table 81). No resistor across OSC32_IN/OUT (forbidden by ST)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 467.675 31.75 0)
		(size 181.06 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f72720ad-147b-5a7f-b603-06f1388fd12e")
	)
	(text_box "Reset, boot strap and SWD pads"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 669.055 25.4 0)
		(size 140 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
