			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d12a4c9-498d-50b6-9407-51215efb039d")
	)
	(text_box "Shared SPI3 (PG9 SCK, PG10 MISO, PG11 MOSI), two software chip selects with 10 kOhm pull-ups so both memories stay deselected while U401 is in reset. Flash /WP (IO2) and /HOLD (IO3) pulled up (single-SPI use; on the IQ part QE = 1\nand they are spare data pins). F-RAM /WP tied to VDD (\"must be tied to VDD if not used\", Infineon Table 1); pin 7 is DNU, left open. 100 nF at each VCC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.72 121.597 0)
		(size 261.725 6.318)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5facc617-5999-5c3e-a3d6-8c952d72ee1a")
	)
	(text_box "Ioff receivers on 3V3_MAIN (rule R7): link from the supervisor and the always-on wake lines"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
