	)
	(text_box "SN74LVC1G17 Schmitt buffers, Ioff <= 10 uA with VCC = 0 (SCES351Y). LINK_S2M: 100 kOhm to GND (an unpowered supervisor reads as a continuous break) + 1 kOhm series + Schmitt (contract 5.3). PWR_BTN_N, RTC_INT_N and\nDOCK_DET_N are pulled up to 3V3_AON on sheet 03; they enter U401 only through these buffers, so a powered-down main controller loads nothing and an unpowered 3V3_MAIN is never fed from 3V3_AON through a protection\ndiode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 467.765 122.015 0)
		(size 247.605 8.477)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
