	)
	(text_box "I_SHOCK (issue 3: 24.0 mV/A after the 13.3k/20.0k divider on 13; <= 3.20 V with the INA240 saturated, below the 3.26 V VDDA minimum used by the simulation notes LR\n§5.1; full scale 3.20 V / 24.0 mV/A = 133 A): 1 kOhm + 4.7 nF C0G (unchanged, rev3 B-5), corner 1/(2*pi*1k*4.7n) = 33.9 kHz, below half of a >= 100 kS/s sampling\nrate; the 1 kOhm also limits current into the pin if the divider on 13 fails open.\nNTC_PADS (10 kOhm NTC to GND on sheet 14): 10.0 kOhm 0.1 % bias to VDDA_M, ratiometric to the ADC reference (VREF+ = VDDA_M), then 1 kOhm + 100 nF at the pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 448.58 261.302 0)
		(size 185.7 10.636)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
